 Handoff#10. Intentional — do not \"fix\" these":[306,313],"#Halcyon — Context & Handoff#10. Intentional — do not \"fix\" these#{1}":[308,308],"#Halcyon — Context & Handoff#10. Intentional — do not \"fix\" these#{2}":[309,309],"#Halcyon — Context & Handoff#10. Intentional — do not \"fix\" these#{3}":[310,310],"#Halcyon — Context & Handoff#10. Intentional — do not \"fix\" these#{4}":[311,311],"#Halcyon — Context & Handoff#10. Intentional — do not \"fix\" these#{5}":[312,313],"#Halcyon — Context & Handoff#11. Left behind in the original prototype folder (superseded — intentionally not carried)":[314,321],"#Halcyon — Context & Handoff#11. Left behind in the original prototype folder (superseded — intentionally not carried)#{1}":[316,321],"#Halcyon — Context & Handoff#12. Managed-fund accounts — shipped 2026-08-08":[322,342],"#Halcyon — Context & Handoff#12. Managed-fund accounts — shipped 2026-08-08#{1}":[324,342]},"outlinks":[{"title":"MVP_SCOPE","target":"MVP_SCOPE","line":14},{"title":"Halcyon_DesignSystem","target":"Halcyon_DesignSystem","line":15},{"title":"System requirements - SRD","target":"System requirements - SRD","line":16},{"title":"MIGRATION_PLAN","target":"MIGRATION_PLAN","line":17},{"title":"App README","target":"app/README","line":18},{"title":"contexts/DataContext.tsx","target":"app/src/contexts/DataContext.tsx","line":35},{"title":"app/src/data.ts","target":"app/src/data.ts","line":36},{"title":"INDEX.md","target":"INDEX.md","line":41},{"title":"MVP_SCOPE.md","target":"MVP_SCOPE.md","line":64},{"title":"MVP_SCOPE.md","target":"MVP_SCOPE.md","line":69},{"title":"Halcyon_DesignSystem.md","target":"Halcyon_DesignSystem.md","line":70},{"title":"System requirements - SRD.md","target":"System requirements - SRD.md","line":72},{"title":"MIGRATION_PLAN.md","target":"MIGRATION_PLAN.md","line":75},{"title":"useChartReveal.ts","target":"app/src/hooks/useChartReveal.ts","line":153},{"title":"index.html","target":"app/index.html","line":159},{"title":"Screen.tsx","target":"app/src/components/Screen.tsx","line":161},{"title":"migrations/20260718000000_initial_schema.sql","target":"supabase/migrations/20260718000000_initial_schema.sql","line":172},{"title":"App.tsx","target":"app/src/App.tsx","line":176},{"title":"views/Login.tsx","target":"app/src/views/Login.tsx","line":176},{"title":"views/Onboarding.tsx","target":"app/src/views/Onboarding.tsx","line":177},{"title":"DataContext","target":"app/src/contexts/DataContext.tsx","line":178},{"title":"data.ts","target":"app/src/data.ts","line":199},{"title":"views/Accounts.tsx","target":"app/src/views/Accounts.tsx","line":207},{"title":"views/Dashboard.tsx","target":"app/src/views/Dashboard.tsx","line":216},{"title":"concept/pacingData.ts","target":"app/src/concept/pacingData.ts","line":240},{"title":"0,5)` positionally, and it can't be sorted at module load — `txnIso` lives in `period.ts`,\nwhich imports `data`) and **nothing dated after 07.17** (`txnIso` would resolve it to a *future*\ncharge).\n\nConsequences, all intended: the 12-month outflow total went **$21.8k → $66.4k**, so every\nExpenses/Dashboard figure moved (the 3M hero reads $16,466, was $9,548). **Rent is now `steady`\n(cv 1.2%)** and its \"+100%\" false alarm is gone.\n\n**Two follow-ups this did NOT close:**\n1. **Power still reads \"pacing over\" (+77%)** on a bill paid in full on the 3rd. It is correctly\n   `variable` (cv 15%) — real power bills do swing seasonally, and flattening the fixture to flatter\n   the tile would be the same \"fixture is fiction\" sin — but `landingFor` only projects *steady* rows\n   to their baseline and straight-lines everything else. Volatility was always a *proxy* for \"does\n   this arrive in one lump?\"; [lib/recurring.ts","target":"app/src/lib/recurring.ts","line":244},{"title":"INDEX.md","target":"INDEX.md","line":270},{"title":"INDEX.md","target":"INDEX.md","line":289},{"title":"INDEX.md","target":"INDEX.md","line":295},{"title":"INDEX.md","target":"INDEX.md","line":298},{"ti