html","target":"app/index.html","line":139},{"title":"Screen.tsx","target":"app/src/components/Screen.tsx","line":141},{"title":"migrations/20260718000000_initial_schema.sql","target":"supabase/migrations/20260718000000_initial_schema.sql","line":152},{"title":"App.tsx","target":"app/src/App.tsx","line":156},{"title":"views/Login.tsx","target":"app/src/views/Login.tsx","line":156},{"title":"views/Onboarding.tsx","target":"app/src/views/Onboarding.tsx","line":157},{"title":"DataContext","target":"app/src/contexts/DataContext.tsx","line":158},{"title":"data.ts","target":"app/src/data.ts","line":179},{"title":"views/Accounts.tsx","target":"app/src/views/Accounts.tsx","line":187},{"title":"views/Dashboard.tsx","target":"app/src/views/Dashboard.tsx","line":196},{"title":"concept/pacingData.ts","target":"app/src/concept/pacingData.ts","line":220},{"title":"0,5)` positionally, and it can't be sorted at module load — `txnIso` lives in `period.ts`,\nwhich imports `data`) and **nothing dated after 07.17** (`txnIso` would resolve it to a *future*\ncharge).\n\nConsequences, all intended: the 12-month outflow total went **$21.8k → $66.4k**, so every\nExpenses/Dashboard figure moved (the 3M hero reads $16,466, was $9,548). **Rent is now `steady`\n(cv 1.2%)** and its \"+100%\" false alarm is gone.\n\n**Two follow-ups this did NOT close:**\n1. **Power still reads \"pacing over\" (+77%)** on a bill paid in full on the 3rd. It is correctly\n   `variable` (cv 15%) — real power bills do swing seasonally, and flattening the fixture to flatter\n   the tile would be the same \"fixture is fiction\" sin — but `landingFor` only projects *steady* rows\n   to their baseline and straight-lines everything else. Volatility was always a *proxy* for \"does\n   this arrive in one lump?\"; [lib/recurring.ts","target":"app/src/lib/recurring.ts","line":224},{"title":"INDEX.md","target":"INDEX.md","line":250},{"title":"INDEX.md","target":"INDEX.md","line":269},{"title":"INDEX.md","target":"INDEX.md","line":275},{"title":"INDEX.md","target":"INDEX.md","line":278},{"title":"Halcyon_DesignSystem.md","target":"Halcyon_DesignSystem.md","line":281},{"title":"INDEX.md","target":"INDEX.md","line":283}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
